  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n            - Branching extensions:\n            • `Match` overloads (typed & untyped, with/without messages, returning value or void).\n            • `MatchValue` overloads for producing new Result/Result<T> instances directly.\n            - Predicates:\n            • `IsUnsuccessful()` – shorthand for Status != Completed.\n            • `ValueIsNull<T>()` – true when Result<T>.Value is null.\n            - Detail helpers:\n            • `WithDetail(key, value)` – attach metadata to the last message (case-insensitive, immutable).\n\n            Changed:\n            - Removed redundant `OnFailure<T>()` extension (duplicated logic of OnFailure).\n            - Consolidated extension classes into a single ResultExtensions set.\n            - Improved XML docs across extensions for clearer NuGet API documentation.\n\n            Fixed:\n            - Defensive metadata copy handling in `WithDetail`.\n            - `TryGetValidationResults` now consistently detects validation metadata.",
